;
; How Understory files a parcel of land in MYRA (understory_rules.h UR5):
; its number, its kind (1 built, 2 garden, 3 crop, 4 pasture, 5 wild) and
; its area in square metres.
^ZXUNDERLAND(parcel:i6) = kind:i1! ^ area:i12!
